    "text": "\ud83e\udd76 M\u014drena Aotearoa, it's another chilly one out there \u2744\ufe0f\n\n\ud83d\ude24 Who could see their breath on the way to work this morning, I certainly could.\n\n\ud83d\udcc9 -4.1\u00b0C in Hamilton is their coldest day of the year so far. Special shoutout to Whitianga who've had their coldest July minimum since 1994 at -2.2\u00b0C!",
